# The talks live in another repo and Pages project (github.com/crstian19/talks),
# built under /talks/. A plain redirect keeps the path and costs nothing: no
# Functions, so no request quota (a proxy would spend one per request).
# 302 on purpose: the target may move to its own domain later.
/talks https://talks-5r9.pages.dev/talks/ 302
/talks/* https://talks-5r9.pages.dev/talks/:splat 302
